WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[Soft music]

2
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[Birds singing in the forest]

3
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
[A bird falls off a branch]

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:05.000
[A giant rabbit comes out of its burrow]

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:24.000
[The rabbit yawns and stretches]

6
00:01:50.000 --> 00:01:55.000
[A butterfly flutters near the rabbit]

7
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:25.000
[Three rodents watch from a tree]

8
00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:54.000
[An apple hits the rabbit]

9
00:03:30.000 --> 00:03:34.000
[The rodents laugh]

10
00:04:10.000 --> 00:04:15.000
[The rabbit finds a hurt butterfly]

11
00:04:40.000 --> 00:04:44.000
[Sad music]

12
00:05:10.000 --> 00:05:14.000
[The rabbit sharpens a stick]

13
00:05:50.000 --> 00:05:55.000
[The rabbit sets traps in the forest]

14
00:06:40.000 --> 00:06:44.000
[One of the traps goes off!]

15
00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:34.000
[The rodents run away scared]

16
00:08:20.000 --> 00:08:24.000
[The rabbit smiles, satisfied]

17
00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:05.000
[Closing music]
